hello there  myth chasers it's time once again to  test out your weird and wonderful myths  and theories in the ever-changing world  of fortnite battle royale  if you have a myth that needs busting  throw it in the comments below and the  best ones will be chosen in the next  episode so  upvote your favorites to make them  easier for me to spot  please think about using code adamaru to  keep this series going and if you aren't  already  now is a good time to subscribe it's  free after all anyway sit your butt down  for 10 minutes  let's chase some myths  [Music]  our first myth of the day is from  crazycut who asks  with doom's arcane gauntlets how many  people can you chain the damage with i  love this myth as you know by now one of  doom's attacks sends a green bolt of  energy through a player  and if anyone is close enough the energy  will leap over to them  and smash them with the same damage the  question is  if we get people together how many  people will that continually chain  through  so i put out a call on my discord and we  all met around this grumpy bush  without realizing we made a doctor  disrespect tim the tatman face  once the group grabbed the weapons the  question was simple if i shot one player  in this circle  would the blast travel through every  other person  well here we go  okay so that was very random it doesn't  look like distance matters at  all so let's try it again  nope right away we can bust this myth  that everyone will take damage  they simply don't so i lined everyone up  in a straight line this time to make it  easier to understand what happens to the  lightning  i asked them to stand up if they were  hit by the blast  here we go  [Music]  so as you can see the blast will only  hit seven people  maximum before the charge empties we  tried this multiple  times to test this theory including  using pretty humongous gaps between  players and the results were conclusive  doom's arcane gauntlets can chain  together seven strikes  between players well this is like a real  science class  next myth please  remember when the cars update dropped  and i thought we'd have myths to chase  for months  well we didn't have that many actually  but one myth took  my eye check this out can you recreate  the car update trailer and see  if the helicopter really does explode  like that  i like this myth so i'm sure you've seen  the trailer in which all the vehicles in  the game  go on this epic road race of carnage  ending like  this a huge ball of fire engulfs  everyone  when a land vehicle hits a flying  vehicle  so our task is to use the same setup on  the same bridge  and recreate that moment and see if a  direct hit from a 4x4 would result  in explosion like that so we set off  this time with a much smaller group of  people from the discord because everyone  was asleep  who knew that was a thing we had a  director this time keeping things on  track  and this here is our first effort  okay hitting a helicopter from a ramp on  a mountaintop  is way more difficult than we first  expected or maybe we're just complete  losers  both probably we tried and tried  and tried and somehow we finally got  there here is how it went down i'll cut  in the shot at the perfect time in the  trailer  [Music]  so that was another epic failure the  integrity of a helicopter is  far higher than a land vehicle and  simply throws the truck to the side  for this to work we needed to get the  chopper down to a single hit  which we did and here is our final  attempt at recreating  the explosion  so technically it is possible to  recreate the opening joyride trailer  but there's a little more to unpack here  firstly  i decided to hide in a bush nearby to  see if the explosion was as wide as i  thought  and would wipe me out too and yeah holy  heck it did  the blast eliminated everyone everyone  except  the choppers pilot so what have we  learned here  the chopper is mightier than the motor  car and fortnite trailers  are not always completely made in-game  let's have another myth panda panda  panda asks  can mystique lift thor's hammer out of  the crater  wow this is big brain material here so  can mystique  lift thor's hammer for this one i needed  to grind to level 86 in the battle pass  to unlock mystique and her abilities and  in real life i just spent real money  because i'm a sellout and i thought if i  didn't do this quick  enough someone else would do this in the  myth-chasing community  anyway so i quickly completed the  challenges to get mystique's new ability  and all the while i left thor's  challenges completely alone  then a friend and i jumped into a game i  was mystique he was thor  he gave his life to try this myth out i  used mystique's intrinsic ability to  become thor  and the moment came is mystique able to  lift  thor's hammer  um well no this was complete failure  which led to me being eliminated  nothing happened at all but that's not  the end of this story  i loaded up the replay file like i do  with all these videos  and check out what happened  in the replay mystique dressed as thor  did indeed lift thor's hammer for a  moment  before the hammer switched back to be my  fork knives again  so here's my issue is this a successful  myth  or a busted one in game nothing happened  but in the replay file  mystique lifted thor's hammer was it a  glitch  hell yes it was as mjolno was still on  the ground as well as in thor's hand  i mean mystique's hand unless they can  duplicate hammers  this myth is busted but hey that glitch  was totally worth spending crazy amounts  of money on  let's keep tracking next myth please  do the stark bots have glider redeploy  hmm i never thought about that good  question  the stark tech bots can be found around  the map guarding the quinjets  will they pop a shoot when forced into  the air the problem we have  is that the launch pads have been  vaulted from the game so we need to  think deeper here  here's the plan we hack the bots and  then make them followers  all the way to steamy stacks to answer a  double myth  what happens when a stark bot reaches  steamy stacks and if they do fly  will they pop a parachute let's do this  luckily there is a spot near steamy  stacks which was super easy to get to  the difficulty though was actually  getting the bots to go into steamy  stacks they constantly broke our builds  in the end we used fishing rods and  here's what happens  the bots fly in steamy stacks but the  surprise here is that they do not  ever open a shoot there is no gliderity  plug on these things  they sort of slow down as if they have a  glider but nothing is there  pretty cool indeed i also found out  today that we can build over steamy  stacks  and edit all tiles regardless of if  they're in contact with  anything at all i mean it's totally  broken up here but i had a lot of fun  i know you think this is pointless and  you're right but pointless  is what we do around here oh and here's  another myth whilst we're on stark bots  [Music]  super says myth can stark's robots use  rifts  so once again we hacked the bots and led  them to the rifts  and although they had trouble doing what  they were asked they finally obliged and  have a look at this  the bot does indeed use the rift and now  we know there is no glider redeploy are  they just going to go splat  well no they actually slowly descend  landing perfectly before going back  into their random shooty bang bang mode  happy days okay let's fit in one last  one and it's from my own son  [Music]  zander asks what is in the locked room  on the helicopter base  so let me translate on the helicarrier  is a super secret vault hiding in plain  sight  the thing is it's completely locked and  we are unable to find the key and  unlock it what on earth could be inside  well this is an easy one to solve as we  have a free camera and can check  in replay mode are you ready for this  mind-blowing item inside  it turns out all your friends are  waiting inside  look all none of them sorry i don't know  why i made this about you  yep there is absolutely nothing in this  room at all  i'll be sure to keep an eye on it  because having this mechanic in the  lobby could be something in the future  so i'll keep an eye on it and let you  know what's going on  [Music]  so there we have it a load more fortnite  myths chased and busted  if you've stayed this long here's a  digital high five for you  thanks for sticking around on screen now  are more absolute legends  who are kind enough to rock my code  adamara in the store then send me a dm  over on twitter  my intention is to reply to everyone  thanks for supporting me i really  appreciate it  i'm adam from playstation grenade it's  been a pleasure i'll see you next time  [Music]  foreign

